                inside/
                    settings.json   \u2190 INSIDE root, must be found
                a -> <root>/inside  \u2190 in-root symlink (realpath under root), must be followed
    
        Assertions:
        - <outside>/settings.json is NOT in results (link is not descended)
        - <root>/inside/settings.json IS found (real path)
        - <root>/a -> <root>/inside is still followed (in-root symlink)
